      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯～！　马娘长崎蛋糕，太好吃了～。\n一口接一口3秒就吃完了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cfe359f73d6e5a12870f211036ad65f2b9c5ae1510e4b8a9f193203ed35aadb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
