      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵！　叫“马娘什么什么”的东西还真新鲜啊～。\n家乡那可没有这种东西……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9062acc29d7d2998eb4de13b1db32dce81507f1aa26a2326fe0b1cc436af109",
